    "Not shipped data and not researched figures: the library ships NO vintage",
    "data (phylroy, 2026-11-02), so every number here is a placeholder showing",
    "the SHAPE. Resolving vintage x location x building type to real values is",
    "the caller's business.",
    "The four `system` names ARE real catalogue entries, verified against",
    "python/btap/modeling/hvac/data/systems.json."
  ],

  "recipe_version": 1,
  "building_type": "Office",
  "source": "canmet-energy/campus — gagetown_coldlake",

  "geometry": {
    "osm": "geometry/Office.osm",
    "_comment": [
      "Spaces, space types, thermal zones and surfaces come from here.",
      "btap.stock does not author geometry. btap.modeling can (create(),",
      "create_from_footprint(), bar()) but a stock recipe reuses the existing",
      "hand-built geometry so only performance changes by vintage."
    ]
  },

  "vintages": {
    "pre-1960": {
      "hvac": {
        "system": "Hot water unit heaters",
